    "春夏秋冬各一款，圣诞、跨年、春节、情人节、元宵和感恩节前后换成节日款。每次更换时 iOS 都会弹出提示，这是系统的规定，App 无法关闭。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One icon for each season, and a holiday icon around Christmas, New Year, Lunar New Year, Valentine’s Day, the Lantern Festival and Thanksgiving. iOS shows a notice each time the icon changes; apps can’t turn it off."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "春夏秋冬各一款，圣诞、跨年、春节、情人节、元宵和感恩节前后换成节日款。每次更换时 iOS 都会弹出提示，这是系统的规定，App 无法关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
